{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id913892879"}, "name":{"label":"Forest A M"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-07-18T16:02:16-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.92.6"}, "id":{"label":"14320091066"}, "title":{"label":"NO LONGER DEHYDRATED!"}, "content":{"label":"Let me start by saying that I was frequently hospitalized for dehydration because I don’t have a typical sensation of thirst, and have crippling ADHD. I have a very hard time remembering to drink water…\nNOT ANYMORE THOUGH! Waterllama fixed this issue!\n\nThe app is super cute, and very customizable. I can even make it so that I can log drinks directly in the widget without having to open the app.\n\nMy only critique is that the app icons that appear when you miss a day don’t catch my attention as much as something like Duolingo’s. Either way, they are still very cute regardless!\n\nThis app is a game changer! I HIGHLY recommend downloading it. It’s worth every penny.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1454778585&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
