{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1791955028"}, "name":{"label":"OppossumWithTourretes"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-07-16T19:24:16-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.92.6"}, "id":{"label":"14312513491"}, "title":{"label":"Actually helps me!"}, "content":{"label":"I drink a lot of.. well, anything really. But this has helped me drink water. I’m usually forgetting to unless my mouth is so dry that my lips stick to my teeth. The app does what it says it does without requiring any premium subscription. It tells ya to drink water. There is an option for premium, but it’s not the super frustrating kind, it just gives you more info and tells you how other drinks impact your hydration. I do wish the different milk options and energy drinks, or the most basic coffee option and the most basic tea option, were free, because l feel like they’re really common drinks. But I’m still very happy with it, and it’s more of a complaint than a suggestion. I know you guys have to make money from this somehow. Overall, it’s great! It’s helpful, and the art is very cute! It reminds me of Finch. It’s another self-care app.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1454778585&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"10"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"25"}}], "updated":{"label":"2026-10-03T16:32:37-07:00"}, "rights":{"label":"Copyright 2008 Apple Inc."}, "title":{"label":"iTunes Store: Customer Reviews"}, "icon":{"label":"http://itunes.apple.com/favicon.ico"}, "link":[
